// Windows resources for RageVEditor.
//
// The first ICON resource in numeric order is the one Explorer shows on the
// executable and the one a pinned taskbar entry inherits, so the id matters --
// this has to stay the lowest.
//
// It is a *separate* mechanism from the icon the window itself wears at
// runtime; that one is set through GLFW in WindowsWindow::SetWindowIcon.
// Setting only one of the two looks unfinished in a way that is hard to place.
//
// icon.ico is generated -- tools/scripts/make_icon.py -- rather than drawn once
// and forgotten.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
